Coreopsis atkinsoniana {{Small|Douglas ex Lindley - (plants 50-150 cm tall, mostly not branched from the base, cypselae with narrow wings, from the northwestern United States)}} 
Coreopsis cardaminifolia {{Small|(De Candolle) Nuttall - (plants 20-50 cm tall, cypselae 2 mm long, rarely branched from the base, from the US (Texas north to Nebraska east to Arkansas))}} 
C. tinctoria var. similis {{Small|(F. E. Boynton) H. M. Parker ex E. B. Smith - (plants 10-30 cm tall, almost always branched from the bases, cypselae with wide wings, from the US (southern Texas) and northern Mexico)}}
